          "answerSpaceMm": 22,
          "answer": {
            "short": "$(3x)^{2}=9x^{2}$ and $3x^{2}$, so they are not equal.",
            "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}(3x)^{2}&=3^{2}x^{2}\\\\(3x)^{2}&=9x^{2}\\end{aligned}$$ The index applies only to $x$ in $3x^{2}$, so $3x^{2}$ stays $3x^{2}$. The expressions are not equal.",
